This package carries no code of its own. libraries.h5p is a bundle of H5P libraries written by
others, each under its own licence — MIT for most, MPL-2.0 for two, GPL-3.0 for two, public
domain for two — and libraries.txt lists every library with its version, licence and authors.
Those licences, not this file, govern the contents; serve libraries.txt beside the bundle, since
they ask for their notices to travel with the code.

The two files that are this package's own, package.json and README.md, are MIT:

